{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284020","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284020","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1028402001:1":{"text":"埃罗兰大叔，你怎么愁眉苦脸的一个人在这里？","source_cn":"埃罗兰大叔，你怎么愁眉苦脸的一个人在这里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x192D8F2E93B5A8DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028402002:1":{"text":"是莱卡啊。唉，雨季快到了，我这旧房子的房梁不知道为什么，开始发黑腐朽，换是换不了了，新房子也没建好。","source_cn":"是莱卡啊。唉，雨季快到了，我这旧房子的房梁不知道为什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x404458C132C1020D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028402003:1":{"text":"木料不够啊！村子里的采集队出去十几天了，可一点消息都没有。","source_cn":"木料不够啊！村子里的采集队出去十几天了，可一点消息都没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF802C7BA84045C71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028402004:1":{"text":"满满不是很懂建房子，可是，要寻找合适的木料确实需要很多时间吧？","source_cn":"满满不是很懂建房子，可是，要寻找合适的木料确实需要很多...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD60D132581969392","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028402005:1":{"text":"照理说用不了这么久……他们只带了十天的补给。","source_cn":"照理说用不了这么久……他们只带了十天的补给。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x167BE51D36C84C59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docu